1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Tram drop-off)

2
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,350
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,600
Su Mu's younger brother,

4
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,880
Pei Yiqiu?

5
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,020
How old are you?

6
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,020
I'm 26.

7
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:04,680
At least you're an adult.

8
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,380
Wait.

9
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,340
You're 26 already?

10
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,840
Last time I saw you,

11
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:15,020
you were this tall.

12
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,420
How did you get so tall

13
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,560
so fast?

14
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,380
Well...

15
00:01:33,940 --> 00:01:35,000
Listen to me.

16
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:36,680
Last night...

17
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:37,800
was an accident.

18
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,200
You're an adult now.

19
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:40,940
Got it?

20
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:46,360
About this...

21
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,180
Your sister mustn't know.

22
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,120
Oh,

23
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,000
I have to work soon.

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,400
Get dressed and let yourself out.

25
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:54,300
Water's in the fridge.

26
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,460
You know the way out.

27
00:02:08,230 --> 00:02:10,730
(Criminal Defense Retainer Agreement)

28
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:31,880
You're up?

29
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,060
I'm in the bathroom.

30
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:36,660
I have news.

31
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:39,140
You first.

32
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:41,000
Last night,

33
00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:42,320
at the karaoke bar,

34
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:44,680
I spotted a guy I liked.

35
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:45,840
And then...

36
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,020
we slept together.

37
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,580
And?

38
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:51,480
Well...

39
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:52,820
It was your rival,

40
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:53,780
Gu Yuan, from Hengyuan.

41
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,720
What?

42
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,320
Gu Yuan?

43
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,620
You slept with him?

44
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,300
I drank a lot with you last night.

45
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:07,660
Then I saw him outside.

46
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,820
He's quite my type,

47
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:11,520
so I went home with him.

48
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,020
Wow.

49
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:15,340
Look at you!

50
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:17,680
But listen,

51
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,740
don't get too serious.

52
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,520
I've heard about his reputation.

53
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,700
He's a total player.

54
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:23,940
More new girlfriends than cases.

55
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,380
Relax.

56
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,260
I can flirt with anyone

57
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,740
without catching feelings.

58
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,620
What were you going to say?

59
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:39,680
Nothing. Just checking if you were up.

60
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:42,340
Good, then.

61
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,420
Oh,

62
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:46,420
I sent my brother to get you last night.

63
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:47,360
Remember him?

64
00:03:58,140 --> 00:03:58,960
Of course.

65
00:03:59,100 --> 00:04:00,500
Quite a shock, huh?

66
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:02,380
He's so handsome all of a sudden.

67
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:05,260
He came back from studying abroad
last month.

68
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,100
He's a surgeon at a hospital now.

69
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:09,280
I see.

70
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:10,540
That's nice.

71
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,460
What's nice about it?

72
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:14,120
Anyway,

73
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,400
gotta go. Talk later.

74
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,480
Morning.

75
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,360
Who's got you so engrossed?

76
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,160
You've been talking for half an hour.

77
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,780
I stayed out all night.

78
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:30,680
I had to let my family know I'm safe

79
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:32,900
so they wouldn't worry.

80
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,960
Someone's waiting at home?

81
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:39,980
Yeah.

82
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:41,840
I'd better go home and cheer him up.

83
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,040
Wen Wanqing is a homewrecker!

84
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,360
(Buyan Law Firm)
What's this?

85
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,440
(Wen Wanqing is a homewrecker!)
Who's that?

86
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,120
The one in the trench coat?

87
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,880
She must be

88
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,760
a lawyer at this firm.

89
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:04,520
But look at how she's dressed...

90
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:08,990
(Wen Wanqing is a homewrecker!
Buyan Law Firm)

91
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:14,310
(Wen Wanqing is a homewrecker!
Buyan Law Firm)

92
00:05:23,030 --> 00:05:25,630
(Buyan Law Firm)

93
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:34,500
About the Zhao Group case,

94
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:36,260
we've discussed it

95
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:38,620
and Liu will take over.

96
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:41,460
Ms. Wen, hand the case over to him.

97
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:48,980
May I ask

98
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:51,340
what prompted this decision?

99
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:53,220
I've spent four months on this case.

100
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:54,740
I prepared all the documents.

101
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:57,060
Changing lawyers now
might not be good for the case.

102
00:05:57,340 --> 00:05:58,740
We all know your capabilities.

103
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:00,180
But the client

104
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,460
has heard some rumors.

105
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,520
Someone made a scene

106
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,160
outside,

107
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,280
so I must

108
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,000
hand over four months of work?

109
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,000
I'm a victim here, too.

110
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,240
I shouldn't pay
for someone else's mistake.

111
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:12,980
It's the firm's decision.

112
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,240
Fine. I'll hand the case over.

113
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:28,680
Thanks.

114
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,840
Ms. Wen, are you okay?

115
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,240
I'm fine.

116
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,000
Last week's asset freeze application...

117
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,480
Pull it up for me again.

118
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,040
Okay.

119
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:42,040
Are we really just giving them the case?

120
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,540
It's decided. Let's move on.

121
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:46,580
Back to work.

122
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:06,520
(Not a single message.)

123
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,660
(She's just going to leave it at that.)

124
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:12,870
(Wen Wanqing: Settings)

125
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:15,510
(Blocked List of Contacts)

126
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:18,750
(Blocked list: Zhou Ze)

127
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:22,310
(Contacts: Zhou Ze, Send message)

128
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,910
(Zhou Ze)

129
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,480
(Wen Wanqing: Let's meet.)

130
00:07:28,010 --> 00:07:31,170
(Doctors' on-call policy)

131
00:07:31,670 --> 00:07:34,870
(Wanqing)

132
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:40,670
(Diamond Plaza)

133
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:56,060
Their egg tarts are delicious.

134
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:58,460
I waited ages in line.

135
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,660
Want one?

136
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:03,860
How did you find my office?

137
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:08,980
My sister told me.

138
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,020
I said I'd left something here.

139
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:11,980
What is it?

140
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,200
Never mind.

141
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,560
I just wanted to see you.

142
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,400
What do you want from me?

143
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,840
I told you.

144
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,080
Last night was an accident.

145
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,120
Wen Wanqing.

146
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,880
You need to take responsibility.

147
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:53,690
(Tram drop-off)
